    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow from a tiny tadpole to cosmic menace in Toadled: Eating Frenzy, the frantic single-stick roguelike. Test your reflexes and make smart choices as you upgrade through hundreds of new mutation combos, fight bosses, and become the universe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173780/extras/f2cced6ccb2eea6f2535d9a6115ee2c3.poster.avif?t=1746011803\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173780/extras/f2cced6ccb2eea6f2535d9a6115ee2c3.webm?t=1746011803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173780/extras/f2cced6ccb2eea6f2535d9a6115ee2c3.mp4?t=1746011803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When <strong>a toad gains the ability to mutate</strong> with everything he eats, his goal becomes clear: <strong>devour the entire universe</strong>. Whether you\u2019re a longtime fan or hopping in for the first time, <i>Toadled: Eating Frenzy</i> is packed with frenetic fun, goofy charm, and <strong>plenty of surprises</strong> to keep you on your toes!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Eat, Grow, Mutate \ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From strange, hideous to wondrous toad forms, each bite makes you stronger and weirder. Ever wonder <strong>what a human tastes like?</strong> Or if a nuclear missile causes heartburn? With <strong>over 40 different enemies</strong> to devour, there\u2019s always something new to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173780/extras/fb94ced94bd8f5b0cefbf29630d65cbd.avif?t=1746011803\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Like Never Before \u23eb</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the ultimate toad with <strong>new mutations, buddies, and item combos</strong>. Turtle shell saw blades? Lightning tongue? Mix and match your upgrades and discover new, wacky ways to dominate each run. Each playthrough is a <strong>fresh opportunity</strong> to try something new.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >All-New Features, Endless Mayhem \ud83d\udcaf</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a <strong>flexible upgrade system</strong>, new buddies to help you, and stages packed with surprises, the action never lets up. Plus, dress up your toad in <strong>ridiculous hats</strong> and other gear by dominating challenges and rising to the top of the <strong>leaderboards</strong>. Want to stand out? You'll need both style and skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173780/extras/a587ccffb0f0aebe929a503ff9128291.poster.avif?t=1746011803\" width=572 height=592 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173780/extras/a587ccffb0f0aebe929a503ff9128291.webm?t=1746011803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173780/extras/a587ccffb0f0aebe929a503ff9128291.mp4?t=1746011803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join The Adventure \ud83d\udc4b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to join the frenzy? Add <i>Toadled: Eating Frenzy</i> to your <strong>wishlist now and follow us</strong> for the latest updates, sneak peeks, and <strong>exclusive content</strong>. The adventure is just beginning\u2014don\u2019t miss out!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow from a tiny tadpole to cosmic menace in Toadled: Eating Frenzy, the frantic single-stick roguelike. Test your reflexes and make smart choices as you upgrade through hundreds of new mutation combos, fight bosses, and become the universe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173780/extras/f2cced6ccb2eea6f2535d9a6115ee2c3.poster.avif?t=1746011803\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173780/extras/f2cced6ccb2eea6f2535d9a6115ee2c3.webm?t=1746011803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173780/extras/f2cced6ccb2eea6f2535d9a6115ee2c3.mp4?t=1746011803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When <strong>a toad gains the ability to mutate</strong> with everything he eats, his goal becomes clear: <strong>devour the entire universe</strong>. Whether you\u2019re a longtime fan or hopping in for the first time, <i>Toadled: Eating Frenzy</i> is packed with frenetic fun, goofy charm, and <strong>plenty of surprises</strong> to keep you on your toes!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Eat, Grow, Mutate \ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From strange, hideous to wondrous toad forms, each bite makes you stronger and weirder. Ever wonder <strong>what a human tastes like?</strong> Or if a nuclear missile causes heartburn? With <strong>over 40 different enemies</strong> to devour, there\u2019s always something new to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173780/extras/fb94ced94bd8f5b0cefbf29630d65cbd.avif?t=1746011803\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Like Never Before \u23eb</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the ultimate toad with <strong>new mutations, buddies, and item combos</strong>. Turtle shell saw blades? Lightning tongue? Mix and match your upgrades and discover new, wacky ways to dominate each run. Each playthrough is a <strong>fresh opportunity</strong> to try something new.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >All-New Features, Endless Mayhem \ud83d\udcaf</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a <strong>flexible upgrade system</strong>, new buddies to help you, and stages packed with surprises, the action never lets up. Plus, dress up your toad in <strong>ridiculous hats</strong> and other gear by dominating challenges and rising to the top of the <strong>leaderboards</strong>. Want to stand out? You'll need both style and skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173780/extras/a587ccffb0f0aebe929a503ff9128291.poster.avif?t=1746011803\" width=572 height=592 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173780/extras/a587ccffb0f0aebe929a503ff9128291.webm?t=1746011803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173780/extras/a587ccffb0f0aebe929a503ff9128291.mp4?t=1746011803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join The Adventure \ud83d\udc4b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to join the frenzy? Add <i>Toadled: Eating Frenzy</i> to your <strong>wishlist now and follow us</strong> for the latest updates, sneak peeks, and <strong>exclusive content</strong>. The adventure is just beginning\u2014don\u2019t miss out!</p>",
