    "reviews": "\u201cI wanna find out what's happening to this frog, you know? I think that's the best part about this game. (...) And I also like that you can upgrade. Upgrading is nice.\u201d<br>MattShea<br><br>\u201cI think evolution took a wrong step here because we have more heads than I think we should but we've already eaten a deer and... I think that was a koala? I don't really know what it was. I don't really care. If it's alive it's going in my mouth.\u201d<br>DangerouslyFunny<br>",
